title: "midnight-agent-skills"
abstract: >-
  Closed-loop agent skills for Claude Code and compatible agents: a work-topology skill
  and a memory-closer skill meant to be loaded together, plus graph operations, loop
  design and daily compounding. The model does not own accept, post, pay or remember.
